{
  "id": "sampleMeshRelief",
  "title": "sampleMeshRelief",
  "category": "page-method",
  "version": "1.54.6",
  "contextPolicy": "identity",
  "description": "sampleMeshRelief({context,bodyId,inputGeometryHash,support:{originMm,xAxis,normal},pointsMm:[[U,V],…]})；明确毫米支撑，1–256个点，点数乘三角面数不得超过1200万。",
  "synonyms": [
    "sampleMeshRelief",
    "网格",
    "浮雕",
    "正式高度",
    "截面",
    "采样",
    "mesh",
    "relief",
    "section"
  ],
  "inputContract": "sampleMeshRelief({context,bodyId,inputGeometryHash,support:{originMm,xAxis,normal},pointsMm:[[U,V],…]})；明确毫米支撑，1–256个点，点数乘三角面数不得超过1200万。",
  "outputContract": "status=read、geometryHash、source:authoritative-mesh-f64、samples[{uvMm,heightsMm,hit}]。返回每条法向线上全部有序高度，重合值1e-8mm去重，不自动选择最高面。空数组为无命中；平行面不产生孤立交点。测量当前Float64正式三角面，不是显示LOD、控制网或解析曲面。只读，完成后再次验证context。",
  "implementationStatus": "implemented",
  "contractStatus": "page-method",
  "runtimeAvailability": "requires_page",
  "errorModel": "Guarded page method returns {status:\"failed\",commitState:\"not_committed\",error:{code,message},context} on failure.",
  "errorCodes": [
    "PARAM_SCHEMA_INVALID",
    "PARAM_RANGE_INVALID",
    "STALE_REFERENCE",
    "INSTANCE_MISMATCH",
    "REVISION_CONFLICT",
    "CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE",
    "RELIEF_SOURCE_UNSUPPORTED",
    "RELIEF_SUPPORT_INVALID",
    "RELIEF_EDIT_CAPACITY"
  ],
  "docs": "api.mesh-relief-edit",
  "units": {
    "length": "mm"
  },
  "inputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
      "context",
      "bodyId",
      "inputGeometryHash",
      "support",
      "pointsMm"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "context": {
        "type": "object"
      },
      "bodyId": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1
      },
      "inputGeometryHash": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^sha256:[a-f0-9]{64}$"
      },
      "support": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "originMm",
          "xAxis",
          "normal"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "originMm": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 3,
            "maxItems": 3,
            "items": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "xAxis": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 3,
            "maxItems": 3,
            "items": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "normal": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 3,
            "maxItems": 3,
            "items": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "pointsMm": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 256,
        "items": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 2,
          "maxItems": 2,
          "items": {
            "type": "number"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "executionPolicy": {
    "readOnly": true,
    "geometrySource": "authoritative-mesh-f64"
  },
  "selectionGuide": {
    "groupId": "relief",
    "groupTitle": "LOGO、矢量浮雕与网格精修",
    "chooseWhen": "按输入网格指纹及支撑条件采样来源高度；不是直接套用照片灰度。",
    "alternatives": [
      {
        "id": "logo",
        "chooseWhen": "在一张精确支持面上按闭合矢量轮廓做已审阅 LOGO 加工；深度和孔环须保真。"
      },
      {
        "id": "curvedLogo",
        "chooseWhen": "旧曲面 LOGO 兼容入口，新建用统一 logo 的定位合同。"
      },
      {
        "id": "relief",
        "chooseWhen": "精确分层矢量/开放刻线/平滑高度曲面浮雕；不同于三角网格成品。"
      },
      {
        "id": "meshHeightfieldRelief",
        "chooseWhen": "高度图生成三角网格浮雕；图像亮度须先解释成设计高度。"
      },
      {
        "id": "meshReliefPlate",
        "chooseWhen": "创建网格浮雕底板，不是修高既有浮雕。"
      },
      {
        "id": "meshReliefEdit",
        "chooseWhen": "对已有网格浮雕局部修高；不生成精确 BRep 曲面。"
      },
      {
        "id": "reliefShoulder",
        "chooseWhen": "已登记的浮雕肩部过渡几何；不是任意倒圆或整体造型。"
      },
      {
        "id": "reliefSculpt",
        "chooseWhen": "精确浮雕精修发现入口；用 feature.edit 更新原浮雕，不是独立 add。"
      },
      {
        "id": "heightfieldSculpt",
        "chooseWhen": "高度图精修发现入口；用 feature.edit 更新原特征。"
      },
      {
        "id": "prepareReliefSculpt",
        "chooseWhen": "准备有明确 domain/mask 的精修草稿，尚未应用。"
      },
      {
        "id": "prepareReliefTopologyUpgrade",
        "chooseWhen": "评估/准备浮雕拓扑升级；不等同已提交升级成功。"
      },
      {
        "id": "sampleReliefHeight",
        "chooseWhen": "读取浮雕参数/草稿指定点的控制高度，不是修改高度。"
      },
      {
        "id": "readRelief",
        "chooseWhen": "读取已登记高度图资源及采样定义，尚未创建浮雕实体。"
      },
      {
        "id": "planPatternMachining",
        "chooseWhen": "根据明确意图选择恒深/浮雕等加工路线；规划不等于几何提交。"
      }
    ],
    "policy": "Discovery guidance only; compare input geometry, section/path, parameter meaning, result and side effects. Read the chosen full contract. These distinctions do not add execution blockers."
  },
  "docsHash": "sha256:9e37fda2a0a6ee3946759a9e2cb2a73de0f19876524e343fa75b3aaf3c62b4ae"
}
